description:
Design a 4-bit binary counter with reset functionality. The counter increments on each clock cycle and resets to zero when the reset signal is active. When the counter reaches the maximum value of 11 (1011 in binary), it resets to zero and sets the 'max' output signal high; otherwise, 'max' remains low. This module is intended for applications requiring a counting mechanism with an indication of a maximum count reached.
module top_module(
    input clk, rst,
    output reg [3:0] count,
    output reg max
    );

code:
module top_module(
    input clk, rst,
    output reg [3:0] count,
    output reg max
    );always @(posedge clk) begin
        if (rst) begin
            count <= 0;
            max <= 0;
        end
        else begin
            if (count == 4'b1011) begin
                count <= 0;
                max <= 1;
            end
            else begin
                count <= count + 1;
                max <= 0;
            end
        end
    end
endmodule

