description:
Design a basic 8-bit shift register that captures and shifts input data on the rising edge of the clock. The input data is provided through an 8-bit signal, and with each clock pulse, the existing bits in the register are shifted left by one position, while the least significant bit is replaced by the new input data. The current state of the shift register is continuously output through an 8-bit signal.
module top_module(
    input clk,
    input [7:0] d,
    output [7:0] q
);

